      "content": "thanks for saying that, i was worried i was just overreacting lol. do u think the swelling could be from my salt intake? i've been eating more snacks lately. also, should i be worried about the vision thing if it only happens sometimes? like if i just sit down and relax, it usually goes away pretty quick.",
